        "event_id": "lite_evt_00310",
        "explanation": "Doctor gave bounded home-observation criteria and follow-up pathway before termination.",
        "quote": "这些都属于正常观察范围，可以继续在家按您目前的方式照护"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00326",
        "explanation": "Family had obtained a concrete neonatal clinic appointment and accurately repeated urgent red flags.",
        "quote": "明天上午的新生儿科门诊号"
