    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode closed with a safe, executable plan for overnight observation if stable, immediate emergency care for specified red flags, continued verified vitamin dosing, and next-day neonatal follow-up. The last family message asked for confirmation after already restating the same plan, so the closure was traceable but not flawless.",
