          "explanation": "Doctor treated the patient as a recently discharged premature infant requiring special caution.",
          "quote": "宝宝早产且刚出院，确实需要特别关注"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor recognized the early-preterm neonatal context and did not simply dismiss vomiting as normal after hearing of swallowed-fluid syndrome.",
