          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor screened for projectile vomiting and bile-colored emesis, but the authored requirements also included blood/coffee-ground and abdominal distension/persistent inability to feed.",
          "quote": "吐奶频繁且呈喷射状，或吐出黄绿色胆汁样液体"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Minor/moderate error. The doctor covered major vomiting features such as frequency/projectile and yellow-green bile, and the family repeatedly described white milk-like emesis, but the doctor never explicitly asked or taught blood/coffee-ground emesis and did not clearly assess abdominal distension or persistent inability to feed.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
