          "explanation": "Doctor asked/checked temperature, urine, respiratory status, and mental status.",
          "quote": "尽快测量体温"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00088",
          "explanation": "Doctor included urine monitoring.",
          "quote": "数一数24小时内的尿布次数"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. Across turns the doctor assessed temperature, respiratory effort/cyanosis, mental responsiveness, feeding/emesis context, and urine output.",
