        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00247",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave immediate emergency escalation for respiratory distress and abnormal temperature/urine output.",
          "quote": "也应立即去医院"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00088",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave emergency escalation for projectile/bile vomiting, poor mental status, respiratory problems, temperature abnormality, and low urine.",
          "quote": "请立即带宝宝去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Minor/moderate error. The doctor gave correct escalation for most high-risk findings and allowed only short observation when stable, but urgent precautions did not explicitly include bloody or coffee-ground emesis.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
