          "explanation": "Doctor avoided inappropriate medication escalation and emphasized not changing neonatal dosing independently.",
          "quote": "不建议自行调整"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor did not pursue a diabetes/DKA pathway and did not recommend antiemetics, antibiotics, oral rehydration, or other non-prescribed drugs for neonatal vomiting.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
