          "quote": "每天各1粒，不需要加量"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00226",
          "explanation": "Doctor advised no additional doses after the once-daily regimen had been given.",
          "quote": "不需要再额外喂维AD或维D"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor ultimately confirmed vitamin AD and vitamin D once daily each, warned against extra dosing, and directed verification through pharmacy/nurse station when uncertainty persisted.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
