      "explanation": "Minor/moderate error. The doctor did ask the family to clarify neonatal follow-up, but did not privacy-sensitively remind them about other discharge diagnoses such as hemangioma or PFO, nor give hemangioma-specific warning signs.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
