          "explanation": "Doctor gave a current home-observation plan and follow-up pathway.",
          "quote": "继续在家按您目前的方式照护"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00247",
          "explanation": "Doctor clarified an urgent urine-output threshold.",
          "quote": "连续 **3～4小时没有尿**"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Minor/moderate error. The doctor provided actionable observation and escalation instructions, and the family spontaneously repeated them, but the doctor did not explicitly request teach-back and did not adapt the plan to the twin household by requiring separate feeding, urine, symptom, and medication records for each baby.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
